
# MangoHUD

A Vulkan and OpenGL overlay for monitoring FPS, temperatures, CPU/GPU load and more.

![Overlay Example](./overlay_example.gif)

## usage

1. To enable the MangoHud overlay layer for Vulkan and OpenGL, run:

```shell
mangohud /path/to/app
```

2. For Lutris games, go to the System options in Lutris (make sure that
advanced options are enabled) and add this to the Command prefix setting:

```shell
mangohud
```

3. For Steam games, you can add this as a launch option:

```shell
mangohud %command%
```

4. Or alternatively, add `MANGOHUD=1` to your shell profile (Vulkan only).


